# Liquid Glass Playground — a full-screen glass (liquid glass / blur) sheet over
# a photo; dragging vertically moves it with 0.5 friction while progressive
# haptics fire from a worklet (stronger with distance, de-duplicated at max),
# and on release it springs back.
# What this test covers: short and long drags up and down (light -> heavy
# haptics, max-intensity latch and its reset), a drag that goes past max and
# comes back within the same touch, a quick flick, a sideways drag (fails at
# +10pt X), re-grabbing while the return spring is running, and taps.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/liquid-glass-playground"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1500
gesture pan 200 450 0 -60 500
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 600 0 -400 1200
wait 1200
gesture pan 200 300 0 400 1200
wait 1200
# Past max and back within one touch (two-leg drag via a slow out-and-in).
gesture pan 200 700 0 -560 1500
wait 200
gesture pan 200 200 0 560 1500
wait 1200
# Flick.
gesture pan 200 600 0 -250 120
wait 1200
# Sideways: the pan fails, nothing moves.
gesture pan 100 450 200 0 500
wait 800
# Re-grab during the return spring.
gesture pan 200 600 0 -300 600
wait 150
gesture pan 200 450 0 150 600
wait 1200
press 200 450
wait 300
press 80 700
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
